Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:05.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, otherworlders come to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:08.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Called the "Lost Ones," they possess special,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.67,0:00:13.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,powerful abilities that have the potential\Nto distort the shape of the world itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,known as Pure Concepts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.67,0:00:21.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My job is to dispose of them before their\Npower has an impact on our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:25.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a priestess: pure, just, and strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:29.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,as well as an Executioner for exterminating Lost Ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.67,0:00:38.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,According to Momo's information,\Nthe target is in that building over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.83,0:00:40.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's guarded heavily, as expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:44.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could take them out,\Nbut I don't want to cause a commotion if at all possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.29,0:00:52.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This outfit has been quite handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:55.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's good for hiding my scripture, too. Good work, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:57.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought this might happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.54,0:01:01.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I made this beforehand\Nwith plenty of love in every stitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:05.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Although I do think she put a bit too much effort into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.88,0:01:37.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's the other Lost One.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.21,0:01:41.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The target I must execute tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.63,0:03:17.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you the girl who came from another world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.79,0:03:18.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.67,0:03:20.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.42,0:03:23.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!\NWhat school and class are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.13,0:03:27.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nishibori High School, Class 1-3.\NMy name is Akari Tokitou.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.13,0:03:31.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Based on her answer, this girl's definitely my target.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.50,0:03:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari. Got it. I'm Menou.\NI'm one of the Faust, of the first class.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.88,0:03:37.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"F-Faust"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.63,0:03:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can't let them see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.96,0:03:39.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:43.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's get you out of here, Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.71,0:03:45.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh... What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:46.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Listen, Akari...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.63,0:03:49.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I heard about you from the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.21,0:03:50.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Other one"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:54.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was a boy who got summoned\Nfrom Japan the same time you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.83,0:03:59.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He found out what the Noblesse,\Nthe ones who summoned you, were up to and ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.29,0:04:05.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He came to my church for refuge,\Nbut he was injured so badly I couldn't save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.83,0:04:06.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.75,0:04:10.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But he still told me about you before he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.63,0:04:13.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I want to save you, at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:17.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know this story's full of holes,\Nbut I can't give her time to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:20.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They said you have some kind of power, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:22.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.63,0:04:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently it's a power that can heal people's wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.38,0:04:28.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Noblesse plan to abuse that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.21,0:04:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even if it's a power for healing,\Nthey'll definitely find a way to use it for no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.08,0:04:34.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why we have to run. Right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.21,0:04:37.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm on your side, Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.21,0:04:44.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:58.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They said you have some kind of power, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.63,0:05:00.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:02.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently it's a power that can heal people's wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.04,0:05:06.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It sounds like her power isn't an aggressive one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:08.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then now's my chance,\Nwhile she still has her guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.79,0:05:17.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, what? Menou...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.71,0:06:18.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-oooh, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:24.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I think I tripped or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.13,0:06:27.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh. Hey, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.04,0:06:30.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Her wound disappeared?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.83,0:06:32.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm such a clutz!\N{\rSubtitle}Did she heal it? No, that's not it. It's not just the wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.79,0:06:34.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry and get out of here, right?\N{\rSubtitle}The bloodstains disappeared, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.00,0:06:37.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is this? What is her power?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.13,0:06:40.96,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Could it be... the Pure Concept of Time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:42.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:44.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.21,0:06:45.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:46.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm taking the Lost One with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.46,0:06:51.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? Didn't you kill her on the spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.42,0:06:55.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll explain properly later.\NGo disrupt the guards on the east side!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:56.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.96,0:06:59.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't like the sound of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.75,0:07:03.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hello there, stupid Noblesse! I'm a suspicious intruder!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:05.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,An intruder! Get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.29,0:07:10.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to make a run for it, Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.75,0:07:12.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-what are we going to do, Menou?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.67,0:07:16.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:17.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou-?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.71,0:07:38.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Her Pure Concept won't let her die?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.08,0:07:42.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's impossible to kill her with what I have on hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:46.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you're sure her power isn't\N"healing" but "time regression"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:51.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Pure Concept that improperly attached\N{\rSubtitle-3}to her soul is most definitely that of Time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:53.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:08:00.25,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,All Pure Concepts have disastrous potential, but Time...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.42,0:08:01.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.21,0:08:07.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It might only revive her through regression for now,\Nbut who knows how it will develop if it grows stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:09.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The more one uses a Pure Concept,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.75,0:08:16.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the more it will eat away at the mind before\Neventually taking over and raging out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:21.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If her Pure Concept were to grow\Nstronger and get out of control...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.79,0:08:25.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Sword of Salt that melted the\Nwestern continent into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.25,0:08:28.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Pandemonium that devoured\Nthe southernmost archipelago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.42,0:08:32.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Material Room that took over the\NWild Frontier in the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.04,0:08:36.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Starhusk that carved out the center of\Nthe northern continent and set it afloat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.21,0:08:41.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Her power could cause a catastrophe worse\Nthan even the Four Major Human Errors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.38,0:08:43.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.88,0:08:45.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:48.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bring the otherworlder with you to where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.33,0:08:50.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What? To Garm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.63,0:08:52.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We have here...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:55.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,a ceremonial hall that can eliminate any otherworlder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.21,0:09:00.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Although we only use it in cases where\Nthe Executioners can't manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.21,0:09:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Embarrassingly, I never knew of its existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.46,0:09:10.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your Master Flare never once relied on my help,\Nso I assume she never told you, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.17,0:09:13.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bring the otherworlder to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.54,0:09:17.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It will take me about three days to get the hall ready,\Nso get here by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.63,0:09:19.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:22.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful for the depth of your wisdom\Nand consideration, Archbishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.33,0:09:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could do so much better, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.67,0:09:31.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lately, there have been a series of young\Nwomen disappearing here in Garm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:36.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hate to think that I can't even save\Nthe people who are within my reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:39.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, but listen to me complain. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.13,0:09:44.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once you get to Garm,\Nlet us have a nice long chat, Miss Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:54.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.50,0:09:57.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.79,0:09:59.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:00.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.04,0:10:03.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, you use chopsticks here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:05.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari, keep eating and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.46,0:10:08.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Noblesse are definitely going to come after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.46,0:10:10.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This church isn't safe by any means.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.00,0:10:14.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this church looks like it's about to fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.54,0:10:16.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like I explained earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.96,0:10:21.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lost Ones like you have special\Npowers we call "Pure Concepts,"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.17,0:10:23.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and that's what the Noblesse are after.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:26.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, these omelet thingies are really good!\NCan I have seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.04,0:10:29.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-there aren't any more!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.17,0:10:30.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.29,0:10:34.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even just the bodies of Lost Ones\Ncan be used as magecraft material.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:36.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Some won't care if you're dead if\Nthey can get their hands on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.04,0:10:39.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What, really? That's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.21,0:10:44.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right? That's why I'm thinking of relocating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:48.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're going to go to the ancient capital of Garm,\Nwhere our Church's cathedral is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:51.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, a journey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:54.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You and me,\Nsetting off on a riveting adventure of escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:59.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What special feelings will develop between\Nthe two along their lengthy journey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:04.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It sounds like you're imagining something epic,\Nbut it's just half a day and a bit by railroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.75,0:11:06.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What? Where's the romance in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.58,0:11:08.38,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,That's what you're complaining about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.79,0:11:09.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyway in Garm,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.92,0:11:15.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,there's actually a ceremonial hall that can\Nbe used to send otherworlders back home!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.46,0:11:18.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then that means... I'm going back to Japan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:20.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.29,0:11:24.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I spoke to the archbishop in Garm,\Nso you'll be able to go back in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:25.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.92,0:11:26.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.83,0:11:29.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.67,0:11:31.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.21,0:11:37.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know.\NI'm not sure why, but I suddenly felt really sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:41.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When I first met you, Menou,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.92,0:11:43.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was startled of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.54,0:11:48.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but more than that it made me really, really, happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.25,0:11:48.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.96,0:11:52.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't really understand it, either,\Nbut for some reason it felt like...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.75,0:11:56.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,time had started moving again after a long pause.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:12:00.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That the moment I'd been waiting for had finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.33,0:12:03.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, what? What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:05.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You must think I'm really odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:10.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But Menou, I'm glad I got to come to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.63,0:12:13.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I got to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.67,0:12:15.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.33,0:12:18.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure this is that thing they call fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.13,0:12:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When you put it that way,\NI've got to say it feels pretty nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.38,0:12:32.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It should take a few days to prepare the ceremony,\Nso we can spend a bit more time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.13,0:12:34.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hope we can be friends, Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:36.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh! I hope so too, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.63,0:12:52.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here's the report.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.58,0:12:57.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're going to officially put\NKing Grisarika on trial for heresy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:13:01.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They'll begin as early as this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:02.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.08,0:13:05.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This will make it hard for the Noblesse to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.04,0:13:06.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's good for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.17,0:13:07.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Other than that,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.25,0:13:13.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,seeing the breakfast I prepared for you chowed down\Nby Miss Boobalicious in there was really infuriating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.42,0:13:15.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No one asked you to comment on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.67,0:13:18.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's just make quick work of her now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.71,0:13:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's true direct attacks might not do anything,\Nbut what if we poison her gradually by-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.42,0:13:24.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.38,0:13:27.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That might destroy her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.17,0:13:31.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That kind of attack on someone possessing\Na Pure Concept is taboo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:34.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A Pure Concept is instable enough as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.29,0:13:36.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There'll be a higher risk of it getting out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.08,0:13:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:44.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Repeated revival through regression is enough for\Nthe Pure Concept to develop into a greater risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.25,0:13:48.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why we can't try killing her in\Nways that don't have good odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.46,0:13:49.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.29,0:13:50.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:52.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, did you get what I asked for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.00,0:13:55.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For starters, I have clothes and stuff in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.21,0:13:58.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And here are the railroad tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.75,0:13:59.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank y-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:02.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.50,0:14:07.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Didn't I say your job was to remain\Nhere and join in on the trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.29,0:14:08.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die first!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.71,0:14:13.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In case something happens,\Nit will be better if Akari doesn't know you exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:14.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You realize that, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:17.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If it means leaving you alone with the likes of her,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.83,0:14:24.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd rather kill King Grisarika and force the trial\Nto end so that I can catch up with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.54,0:14:25.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh come on, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.71,0:14:27.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That girl is dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:33.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My instinct is blaring sirens that I should\Nnever leave the two of you alone together!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.46,0:14:35.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know how dangerous that girl could b-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.79,0:14:37.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, you don't understand at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.88,0:14:45.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've never had to spend significant\Ntime with a target before, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.71,0:14:47.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's true, but-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.29,0:14:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't think you're suited for that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.67,0:14:53.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So I want you to trade places with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:55.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Starting now, just leave her up to me-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.17,0:14:55.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.71,0:14:57.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.83,0:14:59.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Why"...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.67,0:15:03.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To have to kill someone who hasn't\Nviolated a taboo or committed a crime,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.79,0:15:06.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,who's just an ordinary, nice person...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.29,0:15:08.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's my job. That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.38,0:15:13.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then here's what I'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.04,0:15:17.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll tag along stealthily so that\NBoobalicious doesn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.29,0:15:18.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:19.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, and that's final!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.13,0:15:26.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.79,0:15:29.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just make sure you don't run into her by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.58,0:15:33.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Honestly, you're way too worried about this, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.88,0:15:36.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm only going to be with Akari for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.54,0:15:38.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I won't give myself away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.63,0:15:50.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried about you giving yourself away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.17,0:16:01.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Menou! You're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.25,0:16:06.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.46,0:16:09.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait, Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.00,0:16:11.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I went and got some clothes for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.21,0:16:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Something's going on at the castle,\Nand there aren't many guards around right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:17.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll set off as soon as you're changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.08,0:16:18.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.63,0:16:21.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.08,0:16:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:29.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When you said "station,"\NI imagined the ones in Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.83,0:16:32.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but this is much more exciting than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.46,0:16:34.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel like a tourist!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.46,0:16:36.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're happy with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:39.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's so pretty! What is this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.04,0:16:40.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're particles of etheric light.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:43.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The trains in this world run on ether.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.75,0:16:44.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Ether"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.79,0:16:45.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.67,0:16:48.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ether, the guiding force.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.13,0:16:50.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the foundation of our world's civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:53.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's generated from people's souls as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.46,0:16:58.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but there are larger sources like\Nearthen veins and heavenly veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.13,0:17:01.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's also the power that drives magecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.42,0:17:04.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Magecraft"? Is that like magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.58,0:17:06.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think it's a little different.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.17,0:17:10.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magecraft is a type of technology,\Nfor controlling and composing ether.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.83,0:17:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Does that mean anyone can use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.88,0:17:14.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Theoretically, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.13,0:17:18.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you need specialized tools and training,\Nand above all, a talent for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.79,0:17:21.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Statistically, there are more people who can't use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.83,0:17:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari, your ability to use magecraft without tools\Nor training makes you a special kind of genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.67,0:17:28.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A "genius"?! Wow, I'm a genius?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.96,0:17:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't get carried away, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.75,0:17:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Listen, Akari...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.08,0:17:34.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't be careless about using magecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.50,0:17:37.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,People are after you right now.\NYou can't do anything that attracts attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.04,0:17:41.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right. I hear you, Miss Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.08,0:17:46.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll buy us something to eat on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.46,0:17:49.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,An extravagant boxed lunch or something would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.63,0:17:51.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't have the money for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.88,0:17:52.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aww!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.00,0:17:58.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:00.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mommy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.63,0:18:06.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.54,0:18:08.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:10.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.71,0:18:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a good girl! You're not crying! So strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.71,0:18:16.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, you scraped your palm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.17,0:18:18.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.75,0:18:22.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here's your change.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.75,0:18:23.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.50,0:18:29.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Knights from the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.83,0:18:31.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are they looking for Akari?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.46,0:18:33.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, that's unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.13,0:18:36.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They seem to be looking for something,\Nbut they don't have a sense of urgency.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:38.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As long as we stay inconspicuous until they're gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.25,0:18:41.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, let's make that owie...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.00,0:18:43.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.33,0:18:46.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If she uses that magecraft now,\Nshe'll attract their attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.83,0:18:54.17,Subtitle-5,,0,0,0,,What's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.33,0:18:56.17,Subtitle-5,,0,0,0,,Who would do this in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.17,0:18:57.25,Subtitle-5,,0,0,0,,Is it a prank?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.25,0:18:58.79,Subtitle-5,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.92,0:19:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.58,0:19:02.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.08,0:19:06.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou, what's with the karate chop?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.46,0:19:09.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I told you not to attract attention, didn't I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.13,0:19:09.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.79,0:19:12.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's okay, these bubbles are getting all the attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:14.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll have you know I had to make these myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.67,0:19:16.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?! You did this, Menou?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.00,0:19:19.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't attract attention with magecraft!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.21,0:19:20.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.17,0:19:21.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.17,0:19:24.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you make these, Miss? You're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.00,0:19:29.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It really isn't that amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.13,0:19:33.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It uses the crest on this coin,\Nand it's a pretty basic conjuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.25,0:19:38.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I can control the movement\Nof the bubbles to some extent,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.42,0:19:40.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I guess that part's kind of cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.17,0:19:42.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.88,0:19:43.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.67,0:19:48.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.71,0:19:51.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, it wasn't any trouble at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:52.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.50,0:19:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:55.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup, bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.33,0:19:56.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.50,0:20:00.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess they're going to Garm as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.00,0:20:02.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, we should board, too-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.67,0:20:04.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.00,0:20:06.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.79,0:20:09.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just thought you showing off\Nback there was kind of cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:13.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wasn't showing off...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:15.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.58,0:20:17.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Keep this up, and you'll regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.96,0:20:19.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.21,0:20:26.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That dang Boobalicious...\NGetting all friendly with my Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.92,0:20:36.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, isn't that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.96,0:20:38.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Princess Ashuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.75,0:20:42.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you two doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.33,0:20:45.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We came looking for Your Highness, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.33,0:20:49.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How could you leave at a time like this,\Nwhen His Majesty is dealing with the trial?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.58,0:20:54.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not my father. He can take care of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.33,0:20:58.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I didn't imagine I'd get caught this soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.38,0:21:01.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uhhh, she thought she could get away dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:04.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's princess logic for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:06.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come, let's get you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.08,0:21:10.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, what do you think of these bubbles?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.25,0:21:12.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just a prank, probably?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.17,0:21:14.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's harmless magecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.13,0:21:16.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A prank, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.88,0:21:23.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.33,0:21:26.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm heading for Garm. That's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.17,0:21:28.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then we shall accompany you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.21,0:21:41.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.83,0:21:43.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It really feels like we're off on a journey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.75,0:21:45.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't this exciting, Menou?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.71,0:21:47.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.04,0:21:55.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and enjoy the trip, Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.17,0:21:59.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because when this journey ends, the thing that awaits...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.79,0:22:05.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...is the end of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.25,0:23:39.38,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Next episode: Taboo in [Red].
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.46,0:01:11.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(563.2,432)}{\an7}Invoke
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.29,0:01:12.54,Caption-2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(563.2,540)}{\an7}Thread
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:16.83,Caption-3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,511.2)}{\an7}Episode 2: The Lost One
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.42,0:05:49.08,Caption-4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(499.2,331.2)}{\an7}Pure Concept [Time]
